HOLDERS' REGISTRATION CONFIRMATION
As I mentioned, I took care of everything.

201
00:13:17,026 --> 00:13:19,986
The Pyeong-buk Gwan site
was included in Nouveau City

202
00:13:19,987 --> 00:13:21,571
