246
00:15:32,245 --> 00:15:35,164
If there's one thing I regret in life,

247
00:15:38,709 --> 00:15:40,753
it's not being able to protect my family.

248
00:15:41,712 --> 00:15:43,005
In the end,

249
00:15:43,589 --> 00:15:44,924
