250
00:15:47,426 --> 00:15:48,511
Thank you for your words.

251
00:15:49,554 --> 00:15:50,555
I will keep that in mind.

252
00:15:57,520 --> 00:15:59,814
URGENT SALE FOR REDEVELOPMENT CONFIRMED

253
